Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 07:25:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 36/83] contrib: freetype 2.13.2, expat 2.6.2, libXrender
 0.9.11 (GTK+ 2.x leaves)

The dependency-free (or X-stack-only) layer of the GTK+ 2.x stack, all via
the substrate-autotools helpers:
- freetype 2.13.2: font rasterizer, cross-built against dist-zlib +
  dist-libpng (--without-harfbuzz/brotli/bzip2).
- expat 2.6.2: XML parser (fontconfig needs it).
- libXrender 0.9.11: X Render client lib (cairo xlib backend, GDK);
  --disable-malloc0returnsnull, plus a 3-site BufAlloc-semicolon patch for
  substrate's modern do-while Xlibint.h BufAlloc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
